  m_Name: Ruins Event
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Scriptable_Objects.EventSO
  Description: Old ruins appear before you, half buried by time. There are stairs
    leading into the ground. Investigate?
  DefaultSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37c2d0ed5981e9a4fb47a8016bd2f54d, type: 3}
  HoverSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1a3007fd23cc8224d881ec2c582fec18, type: 3}
  TrustDescription: You light a torch and descend the stairs. Runes like the ones
    that came to you in your visions are carved into the walls. You and those who
    descended with you sink into a feeling of utter tranquility. When those above
    came down to find your group, the torch had burned out.
  RejectDescription: "The shadows of the underground unnerve you. It\u2019s best
    to let dead things stay buried."
  TrustActivity: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6d7ef6e69acd6144daddf9b42dc1118e, type: 2}
